<urn:aspace:concept:areas:four-jerry-fractal> aspace:cites <urn:aspace:concept:ressources:l2-fractal-b1-b2-b3> .
# areas:four-jerry-fractal --cites--> ressources:l2-fractal-b1-b2-b3 : Les quatre Jerry citent le fractal B1/B2/B3 comme armature verticale partagée. [haute]
<urn:aspace:concept:areas:business-wheel-eight-domains> aspace:governs <urn:aspace:concept:ressources:l2-8-domaines-roster-canon> .
# areas:business-wheel-eight-domains --governs--> ressources:l2-8-domaines-roster-canon : La wheel 8-domaines est régie par le roster canon L2 (ADR-CANON-001, Notion prime). [haute]
<urn:aspace:concept:areas:fractal-b1b2b3-architecture> aspace:refines <urn:aspace:concept:ressources:l2-fractal-b1-b2-b3> .
# areas:fractal-b1b2b3-architecture --refines--> ressources:l2-fractal-b1-b2-b3 : Le fractal B1/B2/B3 Areas est raffiné en fractal L2 Business spécifique dans ressources. [haute]
